The baseline definition of litru is: "x1 travels/journeys/goes/moves  
via route x2 using means/vehicle x3. x1 is a traveller." klama also  
means "x1 is a traveller" in the baseline, but includes two more sumti.

When should I use litru, and when should I use klama?


